<title>UK: SOCCER-ROBERTSON MOVES FROM RANGERS TO LEEDS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROBERTSON MOVES FROM RANGERS TO LEEDS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leeds United signed Scottish international full-back David Robertson from Glasgow Rangers on Tuesday for a fee of 500,000 pounds ($811,000).</p>
<p>It could be the start of a busy summer at Leeds who have departed for a club tour to the United States without Tony Yeboah, Carlton Palmer and Ian Rush, fuelling speculation about their future.</p>
